# Backend source (src/)

- **index.ts** is the app composition root: it creates the Express app, instantiates services/repos, applies middleware and routes, and starts the server.
- **Middleware** lives in `src/middleware/`; app-wide middleware setup is in `src/middleware/setup.ts` (M1).
- **Routes** are registered via `src/routes/index.ts`; route handlers receive dependencies from the composition root.
- **API layer** (`src/api/`) holds HTTP-agnostic logic and transforms extracted from routes; see `src/api/.cursorrules` and `.cursor/skills/api-layer-migration/SKILL.md` when migrating endpoints.
- Refactor backlog: [docs/current/COMPLEXITY_REPORT.md](../../docs/current/COMPLEXITY_REPORT.md) (M1/M2, etc.).
